    faqItems:[['What does LoptorCRE do?','LoptorCRE structures scattered asset information into auditable institutional teasers and anonymously matches those assets with acquisition mandates.'],['Does LoptorCRE invent or complete missing data?','No. If a datum is not present in the sources, it does not exist in the teaser. Conflicts remain visible and unresolved figures are not printed.'],['Is LoptorCRE a VDR or a public listing portal?','No. It is not a VDR for heavy due diligence and it is not an open catalogue. It is a structuring, visibility-control and anonymous matching layer.'],['When are identities revealed?','Only after both parties have reviewed the blind profile and explicitly consented to contact.'],['Do buyers need a plan to register mandates?','Yes. Every user works under a plan, and acquisition mandates are included in all of them: 5 in Advisor, 20 in Desk and unlimited in Institutional. Request a demo and we will recommend the right level.'],['Where is the application?','The product workspace is separate from this public landing and is available at app.loptorcre.com.']]
